ls track record we're just seeing  over and over again where the first  season is always usually not great with  him but i hope  his history repeats itself where at  least season two should be on the  up i think the show finally got some of  its footing towards the end here but  just way too late  so as a whole i think i'm gonna give  this season  averaging all those ratings i just did  probably about a 4.8  which is really low and disappointing i  just hope for season two  they can fix a lot of this i would say  just  bring down the amount of screen time  normal characters are getting  make dr mallory still there he's  effective he's obviously a great actor  but  just less screen time you got to have  more interesting people around like the  jeromes of the world to make it more  funny and let things just kind of flow  naturally and ha  if you have the funny cast there and  characters and put them in a room  together especially with the guy steve  crawl leading the way  you'll get some good stuff let it just  be more loose next season  and they can do that by just casting  some new people i think you can  really save this show there's potential  here let me know what you thought of  this season down below i'd really love  to hear  all your thoughts i read every comment  and try to respond as many as i can  please make sure to subscribe i can use  any subscriber i can get it really helps  me  i do a bunch of tv reviews movie reviews  and celebrity interviews so you don't  want to miss any of those  and please follow me at steven1 on  twitter instagram for more of me  and i'll see you next time
 

